<title>USA: AMEX to trade Bema Gold options from May 15.</title>
<headline>AMEX to trade Bema Gold options from May 15.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange (AMEX) said Wednesday it would trade options on U.S.-traded shares of Bema Gold Corp from May 15.</p>
<p>The AMEX said the options would open with strike prices of 5, 7-1/2 and 10, with position limits of 10,500 contracts.</p>
<p>Initial expirations have been set for June, July, September and December, the exchange said.</p>
<p>It said Spear, Leeds &amp; Kellogg has been named the specialist unit.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
